  "question": {
    "text": "Let the focus<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>(</mo><mi>S</mi><mo>)</mo></math> of a parabola divides its one of the focal chords&nbsp;<math><mi>P</mi><mi>Q</mi></math> in the ratio <math><mn>2</mn><mo>:</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>.</mo></math>&nbsp;If the tangent at <math><mi>Q</mi></math> cuts the directrix at <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>R</mi></math> such that <math><mi>R</mi><mi>Q</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>,</mo></math> then the distance (in units) of the focus from the tangent at <math><mi>P</mi></math> is",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [],
  "correctValue": "4",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/nta_abhyas/jee_main/images/c68d8e9f-e4f7-4e54-98f2-7443006512aa.png\" style=\"width:2.10694in;height:1.95347in\" /><br />Let, the foot of the perpendicular from the focus on the tangent <math><mi>P</mi><mi>R</mi></math> is <math><mi>A</mi></math> which lies on the tangent at the vertex.<br />Also,&nbsp;<math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∠</mi><mi>P</mi><mi>R</mi><mi>Q</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mrow><mn>9</mn><mn>0</mn></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi></mrow></msup></math><br />Now, in&nbsp;<math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>P</mi><mi>R</mi><mi>Q</mi></math> &amp; <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>P</mi><mi>A</mi><mi>S</mi><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∠</mi><mi>P</mi></math> is common &amp; <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∠</mi><mi>R</mi><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∠</mi><mi>A</mi></math><br />Then,&nbsp;<math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>P</mi><mi>R</mi><mi>Q</mi></math> is similar to <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>P</mi><mi>A</mi><mi>S</mi></math><br /><math><mo>⇒</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>P</mi><mi>S</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>P</mi><mi>Q</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>S</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>R</mi><mi>Q</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>⇒</mo><mi>A</mi><mi>S</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>×</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn></math><br /><math><mo>⇒</mo></math>&nbsp;The distance of the focus from the tangent at <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>P</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn></math>&nbsp;units",
